summary:
  With no text to show the panel item still asks the panel for a fixed width.

history:
  The contributed version set the width hints on every horizontal panel,
  option or not. The option is off unless a listener turns it on, and until
  then the panel must get exactly the widget it always got.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PanelLogic.js

find:
      if (shown !== true) return nothing;

replace:
      if (shown !== true) return { "min": 36, "pref": 36, "max": 36 };

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_panellogic.qml::test_showing_nothing_asks_for_what_a_bare_item_asks.
  Line-neutral.
